1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:04,950
If you woke up in a zombie outbreak tomorrow, what would you do first?

2
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:09,650
Because when I looked outside my farmhouse… the outbreak had already started.

3
00:00:09,700 --> 00:00:10,850
People were running.

4
00:00:10,900 --> 00:00:13,350
Others weren't moving like people anymore.

5
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:16,230
My first instinct was to run.

6
00:00:16,300 --> 00:00:20,250
But running outside without knowing what's happening could be the worst decision.

7
00:00:20,300 --> 00:00:22,550
So I locked the doors and checked what I had.

8
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:25,540
Food. Shelter. A water well.

9
00:00:25,600 --> 00:00:28,800
For a moment, I thought the farm might actually be safe.

10
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:30,730
Then the electricity went out.

11
00:00:30,900 --> 00:00:33,140
And our well pump stopped working.

12
00:00:33,300 --> 00:00:34,823
Here's something important:

13
00:00:34,843 --> 00:00:37,224
many private wells rely on electric pumps.

14
00:00:37,244 --> 00:00:41,340
Without backup power, a power outage can also mean losing running water.

15
00:00:41,700 --> 00:00:44,440
Suddenly, our biggest problem wasn't food.

16
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:45,550
It was water.

17
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:48,460
I moved away from the windows and tried to stay quiet.

18
00:00:48,600 --> 00:00:50,490
Then the rooster started crowing.

19
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:54,230
The infected outside stopped moving.

20
00:00:54,300 --> 00:00:55,850
One turned toward the house.

21
00:00:55,900 --> 00:00:56,950
Then another.

22
00:00:58,100 --> 00:00:59,130
I stepped back.

23
00:00:59,600 --> 00:01:01,020
And that's when I realized…

24
00:01:02,100 --> 00:01:03,511
They found me.
